WEBVTT

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.260
Who'll you wager on?

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.890
My money's on George.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:21.270
I'm for King George too.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:24.230
He has the Earl of Warwick on his side.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:27.400
No one in England can
beat the Kingmaker at--

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.360
I'll wager on Edward.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:34.110
That's a woman for you.
The girls all go for a good-looking man.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:39.410
I suppose so. Just once, I'd love
to see King Edward in the flesh.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.660
I believe he's being held near here?

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.790
He's not here anymore.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:47.540
I wouldn't mind telling you where he
went if you'll show me a good time.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.800
Tell me. Immediately.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.260
M-My humble apologies.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:57.050
If you must wait on me,
I wish you'd serve me a woman.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:00.260
Edward.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.270
I'll grant your wish and serve you...

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:07.480
...a woman's head.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.650
York of the white rose.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:16.320
Lancaster of the red rose.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:22.740
These royal houses with roses for
their crests battled for the throne.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:27.460
People call their strife
the "Wars of the Roses."

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:04.220
Y-You lie.

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:05.930
Say it isn't true.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:11.690
Merely a jest.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:16.980
I'm sorry to say that your wife fled to
an abbey before we could reach her.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:20.450
So, I asked someone to take her place.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.650
Namely...

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.030
...your father-in-law.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:31.580
Warwick. Do you honestly believe
you'll get away with this?

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.500
Have no fear.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:39.710
Once parliament formally deposes you
and King George is on the throne,

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.220
your wife will no longer
even be worth killing.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:48.810
Preposterous! God alone has
the right to take my crown!

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:52.440
True. If I do not take it,

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:56.440
I may well have God do so.

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.570
It's as I feared.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:02.570
I knew that Warwick was no friend of ours.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:05.490
Does he plan to send me back to France

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:07.830
and pretend that our
alliance never happened?

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.170
What did you say?!

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:19.250
How many times do I have to
tell you?! We're out of room!

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.050
Then chase a few paupers
out and make some!

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:29.260
Who are you?!

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.980
This heraldry

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.350
is Warwick's.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:41.780
Not a bad blade. I think I'll keep it.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.360
You bitch!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:48.780
Being slain by a woman
would stain your reputation.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.750
Even if you bought your honor with gold.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.870
Damned riffraff!

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.790
You're a strong one.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:59.340
If you're looking for an inn,
we've got room for two.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.800
You do? I'd like to rest our horses.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.970
I don't want any trouble,

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:08.510
but who ever heard of a fugitive couple?

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:11.430
Come, my guests! We've got newcomers!

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:13.770
Your Grace.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.810
It's better than the ground.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.730
--But...
--Make a wall of yourself, then.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.110
Pardon me.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:32.240
When I was little,

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:36.500
I once woke you after having
a nightmare, did I not?

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:44.130
I never expected to gain the
warmth of another body again.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.300
Not after that day...

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.510
...Henry.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:16.080
Your Grace. The man from yesterday was
indeed one of Warwick's messengers.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.210
He's in there.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.670
Catesby and I could never bring
Edward out of there alone.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.590
If only we had more allies.

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:34.470
Damn. I can't overlook Warwick's
treachery and slink back to France.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.770
This could doom my love as well.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:40.980
Richard!

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.860
Aren't you Warwick's man?

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.320
N-No!

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.900
I came here as his guest,
but I've never once trusted him.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.160
Yet you've followed him all this way?

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.330
I want to strike back at
Warwick now. Don't you?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.160
You know who I am?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:01.750
No! All I know is that
you're a charming lady.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.670
I want you to do me a favor.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:09.920
Take me into the castle
with you as your woman.

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:13.550
Is this a dream?

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.430
I don't want my face seen.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:21.850
May the two of us act
alone except while riding?

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.190
Of course.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:36.370
It's like a dream come true.
I'm going to be queen.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:41.370
What is Father thinking,
imprisoning His Majesty?

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.790
Edward is the one to blame.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.880
Father has merely seen justice done.

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.800
Duke Richard...

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:56.760
We act as soon as we reach
the castle and the troops disperse,

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.970
when they're most exhausted
and least cautious.

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:01.940
All right.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:05.900
It appears that you're
quite a special guest.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:10.150
You're permitted a certain
degree of unusual activity.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.820
Therefore,

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:17.370
I want you to offer me to King
Edward as a high-class prostitute.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.370
O-Offer you to him?!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:23.420
No! I forbid it! You ought to
take better care of yourself!

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.380
I won't actually sleep with him.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:30.260
Me? With a man? It's absurd.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.800
But I can make use of this body.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.590
This detestable body of mine.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:40.310
Very well. If you really insist.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:45.730
But, um, let me ask you one thing.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.070
A-Are you... a virgin?

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:53.570
You have a genius for irritating me.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:56.070
D-Do you have a lover?

00:08:56.070 --> 00:09:00.240
I have nothing of the kind,
and I never will.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:06.460
Truly? There was nothing
between her and my father?

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:09.170
Her body is still untouched?

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:14.050
No. Richard is putting her trust in me.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:19.930
But I'll never get
another chance like this.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.520
Your Grace!

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:34.360
Have years of misfortune
made me forget my pride?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:37.740
I'm the prince of Lancaster.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:41.280
I'll take what I want honestly and openly.

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:44.080
I am a future king!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:51.710
We still have time before we go to an inn.
Care to take a look around?

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:52.920
What for?

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.010
Oh, well...

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:59.050
I thought a "high-class prostitute"
should have somewhat finer clothes.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.350
The surest way to a woman's heart...

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.770
...is with gifts!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.480
I think these will do.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:10.190
You can't be too careful.

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:13.070
What do you say to this?
Wouldn't it suit you?

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:14.900
Would you care to try it on?

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:15.740
No.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.450
Come on. Try it.

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:21.280
It would be hard to swing a sword.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:25.250
You look lovely! I wish I could
have your portrait painted.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.960
How about this?

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.420
Some cloth to hide my face will do.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.960
Why?! I have plenty of money!

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:36.550
You'll look more feminine
in fancier clothes!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.930
That's why I refused.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:44.060
Do I look like a woman to you?

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:46.520
Of course you do.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.440
I see.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:57.780
What a difficult woman.
I knew this wouldn't be simple.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:00.320
But that's her charm.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:04.740
There are a lot of people.
Take care not to lose me.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:09.830
What do you think of my manliness?!

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:12.290
It's hard to walk. Let go.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.890
Strawberry pies? Would you like one?

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:28.220
Shopkeeper! Two pies, and make it quick!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.230
Buy one more for me.

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.020
I'll buy as many as you like!

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.210
Is it good? Would you like mine too?

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.960
Aren't you going to eat it?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:58.130
It's fine. I wanted to buy
you something you wanted.

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.630
Wasn't there anything you wanted?

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:05.640
What I want is...

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.310
I want a crown.

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:17.320
Only the king can have a crown.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.980
I know that, but--

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.900
Even wishing for one is a sin.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:27.530
But once we save the king, I'm sure
he'll thank you with a circlet of gold.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.120
Have you...

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:32.040
Have you never wished for something?

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:36.420
Never wanted something,
even if you sinned to get it?

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:42.720
Even if...

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.380
...I sin...

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.020
I wish they'd give us a bit of a rest.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:55.810
We're shorthanded.
There's fighting all over these days.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:58.860
Convince them like I told you. Don't fail.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:02.400
Have no fear. I'll preserve your virtue.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.660
Hello, gentlemen.
Thank you for your service.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:11.540
Whoa there. I realize you must be
wondering what brings me here.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.910
I'll tell you how it is:

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:17.130
I've brought Edward some game to hunt.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.130
The lucky devil.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.130
Now, will you make way for us?

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.180
Edward!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:27.680
Excuse me.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:31.770
Please leave the door open. Just in case.

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.350
So, I'll be watched.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:42.280
Who are you? What's this about?

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.860
You wouldn't be an assassin, would you?

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:46.820
No.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.780
Certainly not.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:49.780
Rich--

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.870
Pardon me, Your Grace.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:14:00.710
I merely wish to soothe your cares
with all my heart, Duke Edward.

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:05.130
How charming.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.510
Show me proof of your intentions, then.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.430
I see.

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.390
You've come prepared.

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:15.310
Still, this is a rare opportunity.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:16.890
You there. Jailers.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:20.270
What would you say to shutting
that door and joining us?

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.610
Why?

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.190
Why does no one come?

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:29.530
My Lord! There's strife or signs
of it throughout England!

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:32.780
Lords report that it's difficult
for them to leave their lands!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.580
My Lord! A request for aid!

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.580
This vow requires your attention first!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.210
I am...

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.500
I am the king!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.960
The lack of a king is
the cause of this unrest.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:48.970
It requires legitimate royal
authority to subdue.

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:50.890
Then make me king and--

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:55.470
I cannot make you king
without holding a parliament.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.810
Not unless Edward was to die.

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:02.900
The guard should be lighter if we circle
around from this side.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.900
Catesby is waiting with
horses outside the castle.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:06.990
Let's hurry.

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:16.660
Th-These walls are quite high.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:19.620
Take off your cloak. You'll drown.

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:27.050
Your Majesty, I've instructed Catesby
to hurry to us when I give the signal.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.340
Very well. Follow close behind me.

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:46.860
Please make haste. A patrol is coming.

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:47.780
Hey.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.070
Will you join us?

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.040
No.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.120
I see. This is goodbye, then.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.080
Take care that you don't end up hanged.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.290
W-Wait!

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.380
Take this. I bought it in the marketplace.

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:09.920
Care for it as you would me.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:21.180
Until the day... the day we meet again.

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:27.900
When the time comes, I swear
I'll come for you as a king.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:33.660
Your Majesty. Both the time
and place demand speed.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:36.200
We must sail overseas before we're found.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.870
Impossible. They can't have
caught up to us so soon.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.590
Your Majesty, King Edward IV...

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:57.260
...your servant Buckingham
has come to escort you.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:02.310
I'm impressed by your swiftness.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:06.440
The time will come when
I reward your loyalty.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:09.230
Please rest as long as you wish tonight.

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:12.530
I shall furnish you with
women if you require it.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:17.450
How thoughtful of you, but there's
something I want more than women now.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.210
Leave. I'm about to change.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:28.420
Those clothes become you.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.420
How did you know what we were doing?

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.420
I was looking for you.

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:38.050
I didn't expect you to rescue Edward,
but it was a stroke of luck.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:43.220
A war to avenge your brother will
bolster your heroism and legitimacy.

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.770
What's your point?

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.730
It's still not too late.

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:52.110
Remove one of the brambles
between you and the throne.

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.280
If anyone asks, just say that

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:57.860
he had already been killed when
you arrived to rescue him.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.330
Don't mistake me.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:12.340
I want security for the
Royal Family of York.

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:15.050
It isn't women that I want now.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:18.340
I want only one thing:

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:21.600
You, Warwick.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.020
You mocked me.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:28.060
I will never be able
to experience joy again

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:31.230
until I hold your head in my hands.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:33.110
Edward has escaped?

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:36.320
Someone infiltrated the
castle and abducted him.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.860
He has any number of partisans.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:42.080
We haven't located Richard yet either.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:45.700
The king's rescue will bolster
our enemies' morale.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:48.420
Spread rumors that we released him.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.920
--Yes, my lord!
--There's no cause for alarm!

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:56.090
Even if Edward does raise troops,
he could never defeat us now!

00:18:56.090 --> 00:19:00.390
I am the king! The people are with us!

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:05.680
But unrest due to the lack of a
sovereign has halved our supporters.

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:08.850
Circumstances are as uncertain
as a tossing ship.

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:09.850
Wait!

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:15.150
I'm his honored guest.

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.990
Isn't that right, Warwick?

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.240
Who are you?

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:25.200
Who did you say was king?

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.790
Tell me, Warwick.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:30.080
Who is the king?

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.330
King George.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.170
Are you prepared to kill your brother?

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:40.090
K-Kill him? We can just capture him again.

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:43.970
I knew it. George won't bring me victory.

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:45.810
I have no other choice.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.310
I'll ask you again.

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.310
My prince,

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:53.310
as promised, I shall offer
you my daughter.

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:55.770
"Prince"?! What's the meaning of this?!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:58.530
What promise?! Tell me, Warwick!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:14.080
I'm grateful to see you again,
my dear Warwick.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.210
Now, Edward,

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:18.630
claim your bride.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:24.220
Why?!

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:28.010
You told me that I would
be queen, didn't you?!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.730
Circumstances have changed.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.390
Anne.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.610
You are to be Edward's wife.

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:37.940
The wife of the future king.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:42.900
Henceforth, the Nevilles will share the
fortunes of the House of Lancaster.

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:46.030
It can't be.

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:49.240
It's horrible! Horrible!

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:51.910
Isabelle...

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.670
Aren't you lucky?

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:56.080
You'll be queen someday.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.880
I feel like a fool for celebrating.

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:02.300
I'm miserable. Simply miserable.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.220
Forgive me, Isabelle,

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:10.180
but the misery is mine.

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:13.690
I fooled myself into thinking
we understood each other

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:16.310
and fell in love with Duke Richard.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.730
This is only ceremony.

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:20.820
My heart...

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.030
My heart isn't here.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:31.830
Once more, Warwick.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:34.250
Proclaim it to everyone here.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.420
Speak the name of England's king.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.420
On this wonderful day,

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:46.630
the Lord God has restored our true
king to his throne once more.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:53.680
I give thanks for this joyous
opportunity to praise his name.

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:55.230
Our sovereign...

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:59.810
His Majesty, King Henry VI.
